{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backfire Brigade</strong> is a chaotic and action-packed couch co-op firefighting game designed for two to four players. Grab your gear, rally your team, and dive into intense rescue missions where every second counts. Whether you're dousing flames or hauling victims to safety, teamwork is key to surviving the blaze.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Couch Co-op</strong> \u2013 Play locally with friends in frantic, fire-filled action where coordination can mean the difference between victory and going up in smoke.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls for Everyone</strong> \u2013 Easy-to-learn mechanics ensure anyone can pick up a controller and join the fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Environments</strong> \u2013 Progress through a variety of dangerous scenarios, from small suburban homes to sprawling forest fires.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable Difficulty</strong> \u2013 Use gameplay modifiers to tailor each mission, adding new challenges or easing the chaos to match your crew's style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rescue &amp; Extinguish</strong> \u2013 Balance your priorities between saving trapped victims and battling growing infernos before everything collapses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your helmet, hose, and a sense of humor\u2014because when the flames rise and chaos takes hold, only the <strong>Backfire Brigade</strong> can save the day!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997210?t=1770904707","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997210?t=1770904707","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997210/7554d41f7f9ad64910e3a93d00259725f159ca89/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770904707","c